OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mostly dry day, with plenty
OL,6,Fof sunny spells. The sunshine turning
OL,7,Fhazy through the afternoon, with the
OL,8,Fincreasing chance of a few heavy
OL,9,Fshowers in the east. Another very warm
OL,10,Fand humid feeling day, with light
OL,11,Fwinds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FSunny spells through the
OL,14,Fevening, but a few heavy showers are
OL,15,Fpossible. Mostly dry overnight, with
OL,16,Fany showers tending to fade as we head
OL,17,Ftowards dawn. Staying warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
