OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FMostly dry, with plenty of
OL,6,Fsunny spells. A few passing light
OL,7,Fshowers are possible, mainly during
OL,8,Fthe morning. Turning increasingly
OL,9,Fbreezy and feeling a little cooler.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,12,Fmostly dry outlook, with sunny spells
OL,13,Fand a few passing showers, perhaps
OL,14,Fmainly on Thursday. Temperatures near
OL,15,Faverage so feeling cooler than of
OL,16,Flate, especially during any breezier
OL,17,Fmoments.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
